  allLines:
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 763ec54e5ebac7a4fab56b7edd48e3bb, type: 3}
    sentence: "I can\u2019t even imagine teaching adults. You tend to get rigid as
      you age, so making any kind of change in the way you think becomes near impossible."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84293290075aa6c48984f4ed5a1b5098, type: 3}
    sentence: That is true but the adult mind is so much more comprehensive.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Well, some people can be open to receiving new information.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: And those are the ones who usually succeed in life.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 78aafcb2f30c885499b2b92021bfe829, type: 3}
    sentence: Like you.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Loreen
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ccf03e1d53cde149b6ee91d03e63a25, type: 3}
    sentence: "And you, don\u2019t cut yourself short. I\u2019ve read about you. "
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Oh have you now?\r"
    eventTrigger: StartRitimGame
    choices: []
